{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1:u000001", "youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "uncertainty that you feel right now in Dubai is because the future you had, you dreamed, you probably lived already in it, without that even happening, is gone. You lost it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1:u000001"}], "text": "The speaker claims that the uncertainty felt is due to the loss of a future that was dreamed or already lived in thought."}, "title": "Acceptance of lost future", "topic": "future_loss"}, "content_hash": "c2df160363262b177892a6d79ae3ce10f7608a629724b43f31e9ddeb6a8dbd3a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1:knowledge:e3daf56625240e8c", "metadata_hash": "25f7f1fc018807cde4ad32f705e1a900c5929366d057f66825c74d3026264f10", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-02", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "179eb529b6fb71fbef3879e24464a27dced04df464897b02745252cf337c263e", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Zli410Q4hR8", "title": "Acceptance of lost future", "topic": "future_loss", "topic_slug": "future_loss"}
