{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1:u000003", "youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "asking yourself a simple question. Why is this happened for me? And you will find a lot of power and the reasons and the understanding for yourself how you can get a window of opportunities instead of this crisis and make money.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1:u000003"}, {"quote": "or at least enjoy and get new skills and new path, shift your career in different direction if it's needed. Everyone can do it. You can do it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1:u000004"}], "text": "By asking why a situation happened, one can find opportunities, potentially making money or gaining skills."}, "title": "Finding opportunity in crisis", "topic": "opportunity_in_crisis"}, "content_hash": "c2df160363262b177892a6d79ae3ce10f7608a629724b43f31e9ddeb6a8dbd3a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1:knowledge:f54a754138a7a44d", "metadata_hash": "25f7f1fc018807cde4ad32f705e1a900c5929366d057f66825c74d3026264f10", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-02", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "179eb529b6fb71fbef3879e24464a27dced04df464897b02745252cf337c263e", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-02-we-all-lost-the-future-how-to-get-it-back-zli410q4hr8-md-2819a932b1", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Zli410Q4hR8", "title": "Finding o